        "TextSection": {
            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare mitochondrial oxidative phosphorylation disorder with complex I and IV deficiency characterized by lactic acidosis hypotonia hypertrophic cardiomyopathy and global developmental delay. Other clinical features include feeding difficulties failure to thrive seizures optic atrophy and ataxia."
        },
